    BoxCount, mem12, mem13, BreathMode, mem15, mem16, mem17, mem18, mem19,
    mem20, mem21, mem22, mem23, SpinCooldownTime, SpinPulseTime, SpinDuration, TornadoStrength, AirSpinCount, SpinPulseCount,
    BounceCombo, AttackCombo, mem32, DoubleJumpUsed, ExtraAnimGroup, mem35, mem36, mem37, mem38, mem39, mem40,
